.el .ds Aq '
.TH sway-things-wallpaper 1 "" "Sway Things 0.5.0" "Sway Things Manual"
.SH NAME
sway\-things\-wallpaper \- Change the picture of a wallpaper collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsway\-things wallpaper\fR [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Change the picture of a wallpaper collection
.PP
A display shows a collection when wallpaper.collection names one. The generated sway config runs `hook wallpaper` at login; a systemd user timer runs `wallpaper next \-\-due` for collections that change daily or after an interval.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR [default: auto]
Controls when to use color
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
auto
.IP \(bu 2
always
.IP \(bu 2
never
.RE
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
sway\-things\-wallpaper\-next(1)
Show the next picture of the collection
